            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.106.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 106:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa na Arooni baateeranira eihanga omu maisho g'orwo rukiri, Musa yaagira abantu ati: Muhurire, imwe bagomi 'mwe; tubaihire amaizi omuri oru rukiri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.1.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 1:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.10.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 10:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaimutsya omukono gwe, yaatera orwo rukiri kabiri n'enkoni ye, haarugamu amaizi maingi; abantu boona baanywa hamwe n'amatungo gaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 3:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa na Arooni ati: Ahabw'okuba timuunyikiriize, mukampaisa ekitiinisa omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, timurihitsya eri ihanga omu nsi ei mbahaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago nigo maizi ga Meriba, ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli bakahakanisa MUKAMA, yaayeyoreka omuribo ku ari Orikwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
