        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaajuura Arooni ebijwaro bye, yaabijweka Eleazaari omutabani; Arooni yaafeera aho, aha mutwe gw'orwo rushozi; Musa na Eleazaari baashuuma, baarugayo. ",
          "type": "text",
